      "time": "~40s",
      "narrative": "I'll run the Aster Ridge invoice again.\n\nThis time it catches the incorrect unit rate, identifies the unauthorized packaging charge, and cites the exact contract language behind each finding.\n\nThat's the difference between an answer and an auditable answer.",
      "demo_actions": "Open the Foundry Toolkit panels in VS Code. Show hosted models, playground access, session history, traces, and evaluations, then run a quick interaction and inspect the result.",
