      "time": "~25s",
      "narrative": "Here's Caldova Waypoint, the invoice review application the finance team uses every day.\n\nEvery invoice analyzed by the agent shows up here with a recommendation, supporting evidence, confidence score, and the contract or policy behind the decision.",
      "demo_actions": "Show the deployment target and the connection into Microsoft Teams. Frame this as the move from builder tooling into an everyday work surface.",
