        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~30s",
      "narrative": "Finance can filter by escalation, review recoverable overpayments, and prioritize the items that need action first.\n\nBut people don't always start in the application.\n\nSometimes they're already collaborating in Teams, discussing an invoice or asking a question.",
      "demo_actions": "Open Teams and run a short interaction with the invoice analysis agent. Mention the agent, ask an invoice question, and show the response.",
      "screenshot": null
    },
    {
      "locked": false,
      "locks": {
