        "visual": false,
        "design_plan": false
      },
      "time": "~30s",
      "narrative": "Because this is the same hosted agent, I can publish it into Microsoft Teams as well.\n\nSo whether finance is working in Waypoint or asking a question in Teams, they get the same grounded agent, the same enterprise knowledge, and the same auditable reasoning.\n\nSo what started as a local proof of concept is now an enterprise agent: grounded in Caldova's data, hosted in Foundry, and available where the team already works.\n\nNow we've built it.",
      "demo_actions": "Pause on the final Teams experience and summarize the journey from local prototype to enterprise-ready agent in Foundry and Microsoft 365.",
      "screenshot": null
    },
